sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as Cliente/Aplicación
    participant ProxyREST as GetFundPensionClientRestPS<br/>/regional/pension/rest/getFundPensionClient/v1
    participant Pipeline as GetFundPensionClientPP<br/>(Template: PensionRegionalTemplateFicohsa)
    participant LogBS as LoggingRegionalRestBS
    participant ValidateXSD as StageValidate<br/>(XSD: GetFundPensionClientTypes)
    participant RegionBS as GetCountryURLByNameRestBS
    participant BackendBS as GetFundPensionClientRestBS<br/>mwservices.gfficohsa.hn:8020
    participant ErrorBS as GetCustomErrorByStackTraceRegionalRestBS
    participant ErrorXQ as ErrorToGetFundPensionClient.Xquery

    Note over Client, BackendBS: Flujo HN01 — GetFundPensionClient (REST POST)

    Client->>ProxyREST: POST /regional/pension/rest/getFundPensionClient/v1
    Note right of Client: Auth: HTTP Basic over SSL<br/>Body: {GeneralInfo, IdentificationType,<br/>IdentificationNumber, Clientcode}

    ProxyREST->>Pipeline: Invoke Pipeline
    Note right of Pipeline: Política: oracle/http_basic_auth_over_ssl_service_policy

    %% StageDefinitions
    Pipeline->>Pipeline: StageDefinitions
    Note right of Pipeline: service = 'Pension/GetFundPensionClient'<br/>version = 'v1'<br/>key = 'IdentificationNumber'<br/>value = data(IdentificationNumber)<br/>method = 'REST' (detectado por URI)<br/>uuid = GlobalId o fn-bea:uuid()<br/>sourceBank = GeneralInfo/SourceBank<br/>destinationBank = GeneralInfo/DestinationBank

    %% StageLoggingInput
    Pipeline->>LogBS: SaveLogInFileSystem (REQUEST)
    Note right of LogBS: messageType = 'REQUEST'

    %% StageValidate
    Pipeline->>ValidateXSD: Validar body contra XSD getFundPensionClient
    alt Validación fallida
        ValidateXSD-->>Pipeline: Error de validación
        Pipeline-->>Client: Error (via error handler)
    end

    %% StageRegionalitation
    Pipeline->>RegionBS: GetCountryURLByName
    Note right of Pipeline: destinationBank, service, version, sourceBank
    RegionBS-->>Pipeline: URL del backend (responseRegional)

    alt responseRegional = "N/A"
        Pipeline-->>Client: Error MW-0008<br/>SERVICE NOT IMPLEMENTED YET FOR THIS COUNTRY/COMPANY
    end

    %% InvokeCountry
    Pipeline->>BackendBS: POST / (getFundPensionClient)
    Note right of BackendBS: URL dinámica: $responseRegional<br/>Body: $body/pen:getFundPensionClient<br/>Auth: oracle/http_basic_auth_over_ssl_client_policy<br/>Timeout: 70s / ConnTimeout: 65s

    BackendBS-->>Pipeline: getFundPensionClientResponse

    %% StageLoggingOutput
    Pipeline->>LogBS: SaveLogInFileSystem (RESPONSE)
    Note right of LogBS: state = StatusInfo/Status<br/>codeError = ErrorInfo/Code<br/>messageError = ErrorInfo/Description

    %% StageReplaceCodeError
    alt method='REST' AND StatusInfo/Status != 'SUCCESS'
        Pipeline->>Pipeline: Inyectar ErrorInfo/Code como HTTP response code
    end

    Pipeline-->>ProxyREST: Response
    ProxyREST-->>Client: HTTP 200 (Success o Error en body)

    Note over Client, BackendBS: Flujo Alternativo — Error Handler Global

    alt Exception / Error en cualquier stage
        Pipeline->>LogBS: SaveLogInFileSystem (RESPONSE ERROR)
        Pipeline->>ErrorBS: process (mapeo error regional)
        Note right of ErrorBS: systemApplication='OSB'<br/>service, errorMessage, errorCode, language
        ErrorBS-->>Pipeline: errorMappingRegionalOutput
        Pipeline->>ErrorXQ: ErrorToGetFundPensionClient
        Note right of ErrorXQ: Construye getFundPensionClientResponse<br/>con StatusInfo/Status='Error'<br/>y ErrorInfo completo
        ErrorXQ-->>Pipeline: getFundPensionClientResponse (Error)
        alt method='REST'
            Pipeline->>Pipeline: Inyectar responseError/code como HTTP response code
        end
        Pipeline-->>Client: Reply con error
    end
